{"id": "sweet-public-campaign-financing-order", "title": "Missing campaign records led to a $74,409 Ethics Commission penalty", "seconds": 45.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "3762e860525ed5a8", "words": 131, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Lynette Sweet’s 2010 campaign for supervisor received 57,439 dollars in public financing.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.7, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Where", "were", "the", "campaign", "records?"], "sub": "District 10 campaign"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.73, 1.06, 1.32, 1.84, 1.97, 2.63, 2.99, 3.61, 4.03, 4.26, 4.53, 5.1, 5.47, 5.59, 5.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Commission found records missing for contributions and reported campaign spending.", "t0": 6.82, "t1": 10.93, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Ethics Commission order", "mark": "Ethics Commission order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.55, 0.85, 1.25, 1.58, 1.73, 2.54, 2.79, 3.22, 3.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Together the unsupported amounts totaled 24,803.06 dollars.", "t0": 11.05, "t1": 15.87, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Unsupported amounts", "heading": "Administrative penalty", "source": "order", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Reported contributions", "value": "$4,600"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Reported expenditures", "value": "$20,203.06"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.56, 1.14, 1.51, 1.83, 2.36, 2.82, 3.07, 3.35, 3.61, 3.97, 4.11, 4.39]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The order set the administrative penalty at three times that total.", "t0": 15.99, "t1": 19.21, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$74,409.18", "label": "Administrative penalty"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.49, 0.71, 0.84, 1.46, 1.91, 2.02, 2.32, 2.67, 2.87]}, {"scene": "forfeiture", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "Two corporate debts lacked proof of payment.", "t0": 19.43, "t1": 21.23, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Corporate campaign debts", "mark": "Corporate campaign debts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.6, 0.9, 1.14, 1.4, 1.48]}, {"scene": "forfeiture", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Commission treated the forgiven debt as prohibited contributions and ordered a separate forfeiture.", "t0": 21.35, "t1": 26.18, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4,650", "label": "Separate forfeiture"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.57, 0.92, 1.04, 1.51, 1.75, 1.87, 2.42, 3.27, 3.49, 3.77, 3.86, 4.25]}, {"scene": "collection", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "In March 2021, staff reported a default on a payment plan.", "t0": 26.4, "t1": 30.31, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "2021", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "March 2021 minutes", "mark": "March 2021 minutes"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.47, 0.75, 1.64, 2.01, 2.45, 2.56, 3.03, 3.15, 3.22, 3.56]}, {"scene": "collection", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The City had obtained a judgment and was pursuing collection.", "t0": 30.43, "t1": 33.52, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "City obtained a judgment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.54, 0.9, 1.01, 1.53, 1.81, 1.96, 2.49]}, {"scene": "collection", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The Bureau’s March 2021 table listed $32,285 outstanding.", "t0": 33.64, "t1": 38.89, "shot": "march-balance", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$32,285", "label": "March 2021 balance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.55, 0.82, 1.11, 1.65, 2.0, 2.33, 2.85, 3.27, 3.48, 3.73, 4.25, 4.59]}, {"scene": "collection", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "next[0]"], "text": "The public records do not establish the current balance or later collections.", "t0": 39.01, "t1": 42.58, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Current judgment balance", "Later payments"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.84, 1.01, 1.2, 1.72, 1.83, 2.14, 2.52, 2.65, 2.91]}, {"scene": "collection", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 42.7, "t1": 44.81, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The public financing", "forfeiture": "Separate forfeiture", "collection": "Later collection record"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}